 "title": "60 V N-channel AlphaSGT trench MOSFET in DFN 3x3 EP",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev.2.1, October 2023",
  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "A single 60 V N-channel enhancement MOSFET on AOS's AlphaSGT trench power process, in a 3 mm by 3 mm DFN with an exposed pad: three source leads, one gate lead and four drain leads. On-resistance is 9.5 mΩ max at 10 V gate drive and 13.3 mΩ max at 4.5 V; it carries 28 A continuously with the case at 25 °C (package limited) and 80 A pulsed. The gate is ESD-protected (HBM Class 2) and every unit is tested for avalanche and gate resistance. Aimed at efficient power supplies and secondary-side synchronous rectifiers.",
